 "about": "P37D T4: synonyms per noun of evals/play/p37d/missing.json for scripts/p37d/judge-sheet.mjs --aliases. The blind judge's answer is compared with every name of the record, and the synonyms go into the catalog entry's nouns after the main name. Only names a player would also write for the same object; a different object that merely looks alike stays out. matches() also accepts a shared last word, so a multi-word synonym is listed only when its last word names the object by itself (not 'cop car', which would accept any car).",
